<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to weak. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    220-270 lbs mostly 59.50, 50 head 235 lbs 60.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Not well established. Top 45.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-500 lbs few 45.00-45.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    Not established</p>
</text>
